        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b8c74075-6610-37db-a35e-0e5b05efc2e9",
                "word": "sauve-qui-peut",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "97d3f4fc-ce24-3c6e-8e69-883c5c5477e9",
                        "entry_id": "b8c74075-6610-37db-a35e-0e5b05efc2e9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fuite en désordre de plusieurs personnes, débandade où chacun se tire d’affaire comme il peut."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "11ef1fa0-8181-4c64-9d71-7420ef296b0e",
                                "sense_id": "97d3f4fc-ce24-3c6e-8e69-883c5c5477e9",
                                "text": "Avant que nous eussions entendu gronder le canon et siffler les balles, notre marche en avant ressemblait à une retraite d’armée vaincue, hachée par les charges de cavalerie, précipitée dans le délire des bousculades, le vertige des sauve-qui-peut."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efd6b063-f632-464d-8594-1a89ff6724bd",
                                "sense_id": "97d3f4fc-ce24-3c6e-8e69-883c5c5477e9",
                                "text": "Dès que nous éclairâmes les murs qui n’avaient pas vu la lumière de tout un siècle, ce fut le sauve-qui-peut pour des millions de souris et de rats."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed985c18-ce5d-44d1-95de-9324560787d9",
                                "sense_id": "97d3f4fc-ce24-3c6e-8e69-883c5c5477e9",
                                "text": "Dans un sauve-qui-peut général chacun tentait de fuir l'animal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c429ac5-c22d-42ad-96c7-6978114f46a9",
                                "sense_id": "97d3f4fc-ce24-3c6e-8e69-883c5c5477e9",
                                "text": "Mais quand on voit des jeunes couples ou des bandes d’amis qui se disent maintenant on va partir en vacances ! Il y a là une image d’autant plus choquante que dans cette épidémie, il s’agit justement de tout autre chose que d’un sauve-qui-peut."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b50d1bc4-167e-38fd-acb4-890c81b7e173",
                        "entry_id": "b8c74075-6610-37db-a35e-0e5b05efc2e9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mesures prises dans une sorte de panique par plusieurs acteurs en même temps."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "39aaacb9-02e2-4816-9bf3-9eae63abaf3d",
                                "sense_id": "b50d1bc4-167e-38fd-acb4-890c81b7e173",
                                "text": "S'il n'avait pas commis ces bêtises, aujourd'hui, les économies que nous devons faire dans un mouvement de sauve-qui-peut ne porteraient que sur 30 à 35 milliards d'euros."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96183622-35f5-4bd2-b9df-b20eaf9c51f8",
                                "sense_id": "b50d1bc4-167e-38fd-acb4-890c81b7e173",
                                "text": "Dans un sauve-qui-peut général, la mairie multiplie les interventions sur des immeubles menaçants signalés par leurs habitants ou dont le traitement attendait dans les tiroirs de services municipaux depuis des mois, parfois des années."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ebdfa59-aec9-4f06-97be-23a44e043b42",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8c74075-6610-37db-a35e-0e5b05efc2e9",
                        "target_lang_word": "rette sich wer kann",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2b68916d-c035-4a9b-9c49-3fe51430651a",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8c74075-6610-37db-a35e-0e5b05efc2e9",
                        "target_lang_word": "every man for himself",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "every man for himself",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41e41156-3a2e-3d41-8019-e44387b96b6f",
                                        "entry_id": "c13424d7-8531-390a-bdcd-e8e90e570eab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A command, issued in case of shipwreck, that crew members are relieved of all duties and should try to save themselves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26ea60a5-cab5-4036-9b96-d72f763fa451",
                                                "sense_id": "41e41156-3a2e-3d41-8019-e44387b96b6f",
                                                "text": "Men, you have done your full duty. You can do no more. Abandon your cabin. Now it's every man for himself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b42d1608-21f3-38bf-bb7f-b6a96b746000",
                                        "entry_id": "c13424d7-8531-390a-bdcd-e8e90e570eab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression of indifference, describing or advocating selfishness, lack of comradeship etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "every man for himself",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ca9c740-3f15-35e1-8bb8-fc738c949e1b",
                                        "entry_id": "5b0855f7-bb73-30fd-a286-3b3d19c31368",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Selfish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87c9796a-3ae1-4149-8461-da47eabf6da2",
                                                "sense_id": "8ca9c740-3f15-35e1-8bb8-fc738c949e1b",
                                                "text": "I quit show business because there was too much of an every-man-for-himself attitude going on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5634092-d8ef-4582-9032-88e4a7eabc20",
                                                "sense_id": "8ca9c740-3f15-35e1-8bb8-fc738c949e1b",
                                                "text": "There was an every-man-for-himself attitude during the time of the Great Depression in 1930s America."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab41f684-370d-4c2c-966b-39f5eca13f7c",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8c74075-6610-37db-a35e-0e5b05efc2e9",
                        "target_lang_word": "the devil take the hindmost",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "the devil take the hindmost",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13f9c9a3-ac8e-37f6-b9be-bd80ac67f6c0",
                                        "entry_id": "59361103-5fbc-3333-b3a6-d51c9a60987c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of devil take the hindmost."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99d8e44c-310a-4da6-8760-d559289c55ac",
                                                "sense_id": "13f9c9a3-ac8e-37f6-b9be-bd80ac67f6c0",
                                                "text": "\"Oh, don't talk to me about your socialists, I've got no patience with them,\" she cried. \"It only means that another lot of lazy loafers will make a good thing out of the working classes. My motto is, leave me alone; I don't want anyone interfering with me; I'll make the best of a bad job, and the devil take the hindmost.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac9c8cc0-cff4-4575-acaa-65af8c54b179",
                                                "sense_id": "13f9c9a3-ac8e-37f6-b9be-bd80ac67f6c0",
                                                "text": "‘Abandon them to their fate, you say?’ He looked over at his first mate, at the lines of experience etched into his face, and knew that he was right. ‘Run before the storm and the devil take the hindmost.’ He’d lived by that rule since he’d sailed from the Port of London on that bitter winter night long ago. It had saved his life many a time since, and yet …"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cc1e100-8119-40ee-a20a-08b9fb60b9e3",
                                                "sense_id": "13f9c9a3-ac8e-37f6-b9be-bd80ac67f6c0",
                                                "text": "And if fate should turn her back on them, or turn away from them, leaving them to their own devices, and should they find themselves be sore afraid, then they would simply sail away to the other side of the world. They would ride like the wind. They would sail once more into the breach and damn the torpedos! God save the Queen! And the devil take the hindmost!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "96eaec7c-9d9f-4549-b004-114cb256674e",
